# Reviewed, accepted-risk findings only - per docs/adr/0010.
#
# Last audit: a scan of this exact image with no ignore file at all, every
# entry below matched against its result. Two openssl entries became stale
# with the current base and build-time Debian updates and were removed.

# base OS (python:3.12-slim) - same reasoning as services/gateway/.trivyignore:
# base-OS packages in a code path this container (sops plus a shell,
# non-root, no mount/cgroup capabilities) never exercises.
